Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Identify the registered CLI tools and declared BFD linker

Keep the fetched module version equal to its registry entry. This registers
shared CLI build tools and the declared BFD compiler wrapper.

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
